  "2026-10-29T21:36:14.882Z",codex-agent,"Issue 193 admission proof PASS: node test/revert-import-mirror-admission.ts docs/import-mirror-admission-revert.json via pinned pm test. Both independent guard removals fail with AssertionError (import entry limit and shared byte limit). Restored source passes all 3 real non-git native scenarios: small preview admitted, more than 65,536 physical entries refused, more than 64 MiB refused. Native item and full history stay byte-identical across every case. Regular hard-linked audit fixtures exercise physical entries, not logical item truncation. Source SHA matches all prior proofs and the validated runtime; receipt docs/import-mirror-admission.json and mutation receipt are linked. Total completed adversarial mutations: 19; fixed validation includes 7 boundary tests, 1 mirror property and 3 maximum-admission scenarios. Issue 184 explicitly belongs to PR183 and is not treated as a PR189 finding."
  "2026-10-29T21:52:01.979Z",codex-agent,"The regular-filesystem npm gate completed: 451 tests, 450 passed, 1 failed; coverage 99.64% lines, 96.84% branches, 100% functions at unchanged thresholds. Sole failure: the executable schema-negotiation documentation still explicitly requested atomic mode. Migrated that example to forwardOnly and annotated the dated SDK audit without rewriting its historical evidence. Additional hostile SDK identity probe reproduced a third linked item: declared fresh provider ID plus description naming a shared existing ID produced count 4 instead of 3. New coordinator guard compares the declared ID with the exact persisted provenance parser before target selection. New regression covers missing/mismatched markers, both prepared SDK APIs, malformed injected sync IDs, consistent opaque IDs and readable legacy free text. Packed SDK scenarios and mutation proof are extended; all runtime-dependent validation will be refreshed on the changed source."
  "2026-10-29T21:54:32.223Z",codex-agent,"Focused fixes PASS via pinned pm test: 2/2 tests, prepared identity/provenance consistency plus the actual executable reviewed-apply example. Before the guard, the same native SDK identity probe failed with 4 items instead of 3 (third linked create); after it, mismatched/missing provenance conflicts before selecting a target, both prepared APIs set exit 1, consistent opaque IDs and old free-text records remain usable. Runtime source SHA256 is now 0589fe16b65a307fe068333a26cd72a47acf96dc0bf7945ef79f0d7a30e05245. Added the corresponding behavior revert and packed checks (31 SDK checks per layout). Fresh full npm/Bun gates, all mutation proofs and packed artifact acceptance are required for this changed runtime; earlier receipts remain historical until refreshed."
  "2026-10-29T22:04:24.713Z",codex,"Final-source revert proofs PASS: 14 boundary behavior reverts, 4 mirror-policy controls and 2 maximum-quota guard removals all fail independently. Restored source passes 8 boundary tests, 1 mirror property and 3 admission scenarios. Every receipt binds source SHA256 0589fe16b65a307fe068333a26cd72a47acf96dc0bf7945ef79f0d7a30e05245. All reverts ran only in owned copies; reviewed checkout never mutated. This fresh combined mirror run is complete; prior interrupted-source evidence remains in append-only comments. Refreshed packed matrix starts with 31 SDK checks per layout. New full npm gate is active with unchanged thresholds; Bun remains serial."
  "2026-10-29T22:05:12.304Z",codex-agent,"Author correction: the immediately preceding proof-summary comment used the pinned CLI default codex because that one command omitted PM_AUTHOR. This append-only correction records codex-agent ownership of the same completed validation: 14 boundary reverts, 4 mirror controls and 2 quota-guard removals fail independently; fixed checks pass 8 boundary tests, 1 mirror property and 3 admission scenarios. Receipts bind source SHA256 0589fe16b65a307fe068333a26cd72a47acf96dc0bf7945ef79f0d7a30e05245. No existing comment or history entry was edited or removed; the own claim remains codex-agent."
  "2026-10-29T22:26:08.762Z",codex-agent,Current-source npm run reached the unchanged 900-second seed-1620 timer after the 400/500 milestone. No assertion failure preceded the cancellation. Other tests continue; this is not a passing gate claim. Production source remains 0589fe16b65a307fe068333a26cd72a47acf96dc0bf7945ef79f0d7a30e05245. Retaining the full output and unchanged test timeout; the serial Bun gate and exact-head CI will re-run the case. Only a successful retry or CI result can classify this as a host-load timeout under the task rule.
  "2026-10-29T22:44:30.592Z",codex-agent,"Latest runtime consumer acceptance PASS: all 10 layouts, 830 commands, 310 SDK checks, 200 process-status cases, zero provider mutations. Artifact b38b9aed417eb15b3d9551ce86a404f9e6c069fc1d2df2d7420eae1774b1e449 matched all 9 shipped files and rejected an ignored dist mutation. Remote main advanced with release notes only (PR192); incorporating it changes shipped CHANGELOG bytes, so current-artifact acceptance will be refreshed after merge. The local npm run has one unchanged seed-1620 timer cancellation and was stopped to free host capacity after that known non-passing result; no local gate pass is claimed. Dedicated exact-head CI will execute full npm and Bun release gates. Current-source behavioral proofs (20 failing mutations with restored successes) remain valid because main changes no runtime code."
  "2026-10-29T23:14:43.007Z",codex-agent,"Final shipped archive PASS after merging main release notes: all 10 consumer layouts, 830 commands, 310 SDK checks, 200 process-status cases, zero provider mutations. Exact verification matches all 9 shipped files, rejects ignored dist mutation and verifies restoration. Artifact SHA256 7833dbef22e41e814eb87243f308dc122bb7c3b0083cddf3a88e159896095d10. Runtime SHA256 0589fe16b65a307fe068333a26cd72a47acf96dc0bf7945ef79f0d7a30e05245. Typecheck, test compilation, 112-declaration docstrings, generated changelog, release date and publish attestation checks pass; clean-identity strict health passes with unchanged legacy advisories; production audit reports 0 vulnerabilities. Full npm/Bun verification is delegated to the exact pushed-head CI at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/189/checks after the local seed-1620 unchanged 900-second timer was hit under load. No current local full-gate pass is claimed. Work item stays in_progress for orchestrator verification; releasing only my codex-agent claim."
  "2026-10-29T23:22:21.868Z",codex-agent,"Exact pushed-head DeepScan finding 238955540 is a test dataflow limitation: strict assert.equal(payloads?.length,3) already throws when payloads are absent, so the following filter cannot dereference absent payloads at runtime. Added explicit assert.ok(payloads), retained the exact length/conflict assertions, and removed optional access to make the invariant statically visible. No production code or shipped file changes. Required CI jobs are queued. Reclaimed own item for this test-only follow-up; the original 23:46:59 UTC CI cutoff remains unchanged."
  "2026-10-29T23:23:51.000Z",codex-agent,"DeepScan clarification verified: focused identity export test passes (1/1) and full test compilation passes with the explicit payload presence assertion. All previous exact length, conflict count and mutation-exclusion checks are retained. Production SHA and final archive SHA are unchanged. Releasing own claim again and pushing only this test plus its PM evidence; original CI cutoff 23:46:59 UTC remains in force."
